&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Associated with Pace University&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed and developed an AI-enabled smart glasses platform to support real-time communication, clinical documentation, and decision support for emergency medical services (EMS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed hands-free smart glasses, AI-assisted documentation, and clinical decision support systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluated the platform with 30+ EMS teams and 120+ EMS/ED providers through user-centered design and usability studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Published peer-reviewed research in CSCW, ICHI, IJHCI, and AMIA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="smart-glasses-prototype"&gt;Smart Glasses Prototype&lt;/h2&gt;
